<title>GERMANY: Hypo-Bank satisfied with early 97 results.</title>
<headline>Hypo-Bank satisfied with early 97 results.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Hypotheken und Wechselbank, Hypo-Bank, said on Wednesday that its earnings growth in January and February was very satisfactory.</p>
<p>At a news conference the group said that results had been &quot;very satisfactory&quot; during the first two months of the year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
